 "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-7 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/state.json" "file_sha256" "75661d8cdcfeae369dbfac0e887fbab0e2fb2a4c43ef6ceec0b8a442517b4276"} {"question" "q-34226" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/state.json" "file_sha256" "75661d8cdcfeae369dbfac0e887fbab0e2fb2a4c43ef6ceec0b8a442517b4276"} {"question" "q-34227" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If $u=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ and $v=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]$, then $u\\cdot v=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/state.json" "file_sha256" "75661d8cdcfeae369dbfac0e887fbab0e2fb2a4c43ef6ceec0b8a442517b4276"} {"question" "q-34227" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To compute the dot product, we add up the products of corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot v & ={u}_{1}\\cdot {v}_{1}+{u}_{2}\\cdot {v}_{2}+{u}_{3}\\cdot {v}_{3}+{u}_{4}\\cdot {v}_{4} \\\\  & =(-4)\\cdot 2+1\\cdot (-4)+2\\cdot 6+3\\cdot (-7) \\\\  & =-8-4+12-21 \\\\  & =-21\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/state.json" "file_sha256" "75661d8cdcfeae369dbfac0e887fbab0e2fb2a4c43ef6ceec0b8a442517b4276"} {"question" "q-34227" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8d61b54b933e218322ca738b2b317f663e9af4d08773e3b029d666bf4b3c0dcf"} {"question" "q-34227" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/state.json" "file_sha256" "75661d8cdcfeae369dbfac0e887fbab0e2fb2a4c43ef6ceec0b8a442517b4276"} {"question" "q-34227" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-21"] ["math" "-33"] ["math" "-45"] ["math" "12"] ["math" "9"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/state.json" "file_sha256" "75661d8cdcfeae369dbfac0e887fbab0e2fb2a4c43ef6ceec0b8a442517b4276"} {"question" "q-34227" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-21"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/state.json" "file_sha256" "75661d8cdcfeae369dbfac0e887fbab0e2fb2a4c43ef6ceec0b8a442517b4276"} {"question" "q-73941" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $c=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 12 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ and $d=[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}].$ What is $(-\\frac{1}{3}c)\\cdot d?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/state.json" "file_sha256" "75661d8cdcfeae369dbfac0e887fbab0e2fb2a4c43ef6ceec0b8a442517b4276"} {"question" "q-73941" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, multiplying each component of $c$ by $-\\frac{1}{3}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{3}c & =-\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 12 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo compute the dot product, we add up the products of corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-\\frac{1}{3}c)\\cdot d & =0\\cdot 9+2\\cdot 4+(-4)\\cdot (-2)+(-3)\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =0+8+8-3-6 \\\\  & =7\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/state.json" "file_sha256" "75661d8cdcfeae369dbfac0e887fbab0e2fb2a4c43ef6ceec0b8a442517b4276"} {"question" "q-73941" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8d61b54b933e218322ca738b2b317f663e9af4d08773e3b029d666bf4b3c0dcf"} {"question" "q-73941" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/state.json" "file_sha256" "75661d8cdcfeae369dbfac0e887fbab0e2fb2a4c43ef6ceec0b8a442517b4276"} {"question" "q-73941" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-14"] ["math" "-21"] ["math" "-7"] ["math" "21"] ["math" "7"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037236/state.json" "file_sha256" "75661d8cdcfeae369dbfac0e887fbab0e2fb2a4c43ef6ceec0b8a442517b4276"} {"question" "q-73941" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "7"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer